{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788809607102358001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cob-portable-springbok","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f24d14e95d9e25e977b87285ad3cf466eeea4f6d317362efa86763ae7a9b3e4e","event_uuid":"b56ebc50-f8ac-4a55-8348-8d843c2a6eeb","position":{"commit_sha":"a6eb1aab104fa3ed653707eab4dc5351fb47e329","position":"1788807518875429334-b56ebc50-f8ac-4a55-8348-8d843c2a6eeb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0762ce4f2e47095205df56c3af81eb70e768991b5a07e5b52a690b35000a0534","event_uuid":"f74c5ccd-15c8-4e36-826f-4054a5d51169","position":{"commit_sha":"4484ed8a30bdfaa7fe6a1e34ed59a55611b61314","position":"1788807580409031839-f74c5ccd-15c8-4e36-826f-4054a5d51169"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f9052ee0ded789e79d9733ab8fc546ae91c74cbcfc67468d343f96c5e527b760","event_uuid":"61b7b719-3908-4166-b0fe-bbb480cd6977","position":{"commit_sha":"c9238c0996b9b28bd94f31e53a89484d638558af","position":"1788807634667715826-61b7b719-3908-4166-b0fe-bbb480cd6977"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788807518875429334,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"61b7b719-3908-4166-b0fe-bbb480cd6977","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"4b2a-e417-30ed-4f3a"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nRepo-root scratch (`<repo>/bridge_state/`) is written by `fetcher.py:630-633`, `applier.py:560-563,669-672`, `apply_planning.py:341-356`, `load_phase.py:180-181,200-201`, `alert_store.py:23-28`, `dispatch_one.py:165`, `apply_inbound.py:107`, `apply_handlers.py:598`, `invariants.py:404`; it grows unbounded, sits at the repo root (bug `germinable-cosey-vireo` symptom), and `reconcile.py:150-151` falsely documents the prev snapshot there (it is `<tracker>/.bridge_state/prev_snapshot.json`, `load_phase.py:210-212`). `.gitignore:24` `.rebar/*` ignores everything under `.rebar/` with surgical un-ignores (`:25-47`), so `.rebar/bridge/` needs no new pattern and `.gitignore:14` `bridge_state/` becomes dead. `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py` uses the git file list (bug `germinable-cosey-vireo`, closed); only its comment `:28` names `bridge_state/`. Tracker-side `<tracker>/.bridge_state/` (bindings, projects, prev_snapshot, last-pass) is committed state and is not renamed. Cites are on origin/main 083620b0 (engine paths are under `src/rebar/reconciler/` after the package move).\n\n## Approach\n1. New `src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py` (~120 LOC): `BRIDGE_SCRATCH_SUBDIR = Path(\".rebar\")/\"bridge\"`, `bridge_scratch_dir(repo_root)`, `snapshots_dir()`, `alerts_dir()`, `sync_log_path(repo_root, pass_id)`, `mapping_path()`, `divergence_state_path()`, constants `RETAIN_SNAPSHOT_PASSES = 5`, `RETAIN_SYNC_LOGS = 5`, `RETAIN_ALERT_DAYS = 30`, and `prune_bridge_scratch(repo_root, *, keep_passes=…, keep_logs=…, keep_alert_days=…) -> dict[str, int]` — best-effort, exception-swallowing (`logger.warning`), mirroring `llm/completion_sidecar.py:46,248-275` (`RETAIN_PER_TICKET`, `prune(keep=…)`): snapshots grouped by pass-id prefix (`<pass>.json`, `<pass>.manifest.json`, stray `<pass>.*.json.tmp`), newest-by-name (pass ids are `%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S`, lexically ordered); `sync-log-*.jsonl` by name; `bridge_alerts/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl` keeps the 30 newest files. `mapping.json` and `comment_id_divergence.json` are cross-pass state and are never pruned.\n2. Every writer module imports these path helpers (`alert_store._STATE_SUBDIR` deleted).\n3. Call `prune_bridge_scratch(ctx.repo_root)` in `persist_phase.persist_and_log` after `sync_logger.close()` (`:269`), guarded by `if persist:`.\n4. Fix `reconcile.py:150-151`; `docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md:72` row → `<repo_root>/.rebar/bridge/bridge_alerts/*.jsonl`; delete `.gitignore:14`; update the `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:28` comment; update the paths in `docs/user-guide.md`, `docs/jira-sync-setup.md`, `docs/concurrency.md`.\n5. Tests: the 54 files matched by `git grep -lE '(^|[^._A-Za-z])bridge_state' origin/main -- tests` re-spell the path via the helpers, excluding `tests/fixtures/dc_wiki_corpus/prose.json` (a frozen fixture that must not change) and `tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py` (stays as-is). New `tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py`. No migration of existing `bridge_state/` dirs (scratch; operators delete it).\n\nBREAKING: reconciler scratch moves from `<repo>/bridge_state/` to `<repo>/.rebar/bridge/`; snapshots and sync logs keep the last 5 passes, alerts the last 30 days.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py` (new), the nine writer modules `src/rebar/reconciler/{alert_store,fetcher,applier,apply_planning,load_phase,dispatch_one,apply_inbound,apply_handlers,invariants}.py`, `src/rebar/reconciler/persist_phase.py`, `src/rebar/reconciler/reconcile.py`, `.gitignore`, `docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md:72`, `docs/user-guide.md`, `docs/jira-sync-setup.md`, `docs/concurrency.md`, `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:28`, the tests named above. Out of scope: tracker-side `<tracker>/.bridge_state/` (committed state, not renamed), any new `.gitignore` pattern, and migration of existing scratch dirs.\n\n## Testing\nHappy: `pytest tests/unit/reconciler/state tests/unit/reconciler/fetch tests/unit/reconciler/orchestrate -q`; a live-mode `reconcile_once` in a tmp repo writes under `<root>/.rebar/bridge/` and nothing under `<root>/bridge_state/`. Edge (new `tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py`): seed 7 pass ids × (`.json` + `.manifest.json`) + 7 sync logs + 35 alert days → prune leaves 5/5/30 newest and returns `{\"snapshots\": 4, \"sync_logs\": 2, \"alerts\": 5}`; unreadable dir → returns zeros, no raise; a preview pass (`persist=False`) does not prune; `git status --porcelain` after a pass shows no untracked `.rebar/bridge` (covered by `.rebar/*`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `git grep -nE '(^|[^._A-Za-z])bridge_state' -- src scripts .gitignore` is empty — grep.\n- [ ] Retention test passes with the exact counts above — `pytest tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_scratch_retention.py -q`.\n- [ ] `reconcile.py` docstring names `<tracker>/.bridge_state/prev_snapshot.json` — grep.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0; `make lint` exits 0 in a checkout that has run a live pass (vocabulary guard unaffected).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/scratch_retention.py","reason":"paths + prune"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py","reason":"use helper"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/applier.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_planning.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/load_phase.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_inbound.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/apply_handlers.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/invariants.py","reason":"path"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/persist_phase.py","reason":"end-of-pass prune"},{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/reconcile.py","reason":"docstring fix"},{"path":".gitignore","reason":"drop bridge_state/"},{"path":"docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md","reason":"row 72"},{"path":"docs/user-guide.md","reason":"scratch path"},{"path":"docs/jira-sync-setup.md","reason":"scratch path"},{"path":"docs/concurrency.md","reason":"scratch path"},{"path":"scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py","reason":"comment"},{"path":"tests/","reason":"54 files re-spelled + retention test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","4b2a-e417-30ed-4f3a"],["parent","ebf5-5d21-0124-4313"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"ebf5-5d21-0124-4313","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_id":"e6ee-ae52-8e5d-4917","ticket_type":"story","title":"Move reconciler scratch from bridge_state/ to .rebar/bridge/ with keep-last-N retention","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b56ebc50-f8ac-4a55-8348-8d843c2a6eeb","f74c5ccd-15c8-4e36-826f-4054a5d51169","61b7b719-3908-4166-b0fe-bbb480cd6977"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788809607102358001,"uuid":"e2e2d645-fc34-4970-865a-14ee63862817"}